window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I wanted a baby, but I never dreamed my grumpy boss would be the daddy!</b></p> <p>When I accidentally give gorgeous and terrifying kingpin Dexter Streatham my list of baby daddy requirements, I expect to be fired.</p> <p>After all, the list describes him exactly, down to <i>intimate details</i>.</p> <p>Instead, he offers to marry me and get me pregnant. But if he takes my V-card he’s sure to notice I’m hopelessly in love with him, so I refuse.</p> <p>He bets me that he’ll put a baby in my belly within six months, or he’ll find me a new husband himself.</p> <p>I can’t say no. Having my boss’ baby is everything I've ever wanted, even if it might break my heart.</p> <p>But the possessive way he says “mine” as he sits me on his desk and kisses me, his hands gripping my hair, makes me wonder: would he ever let me go…?</p> <p><i>Groom Gamble is a sweet and spicy mafia romcom with an obsessed and protective hero and his innocent assistant who he’s going to give a baby.</i></p>"; 
